      "description": "The throttle, seen from the other side. repro_heartbeat_sent is incremented at every ctx.Heartbeat() call site, before Core sees it. temporal_request{operation=RecordActivityTaskHeartbeat} counts what survived. The gap IS the throttle, and it is the gap between your Cloud bill and your intuition.",
