    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cancellation reasons, SDK view",
      "description": "Emitted from the activity's catch block as ctx.CancelReason.ToString(). Nothing built in reports this -- the server sees 'cancelled', not why.\n\nThe .NET values: CancelRequested (workflow or client cancelled), GoneFromServer (the heartbeat RPC came back NOT_FOUND -- the activity already timed out or its workflow closed), WorkerShutdown (fired GracefulShutdownTimeout after WorkerShutdownToken), Timeout, HeartbeatRecordFailure (your heartbeat details failed to serialize -- anonymous types and delegates do this silently), Paused, Reset, None.",
