    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Checkpoint staleness on resume p95",
      "description": "How much work gets redone. Measured in the activity as now - checkpoint.RecordedAtUtc at the moment of resume, which requires the heartbeat detail to be a record carrying a timestamp -- a plain int progress counter cannot answer this.\n\nThe overlaid throttle line is the theoretical upper bound: Core coalesces heartbeats, so the details the server holds can be up to one full throttle interval old. If p95 staleness sits near that line, your resume logic had better be idempotent, because it is reprocessing that much work on every retry.\n\nCustom histograms land in Core's catch-all bucket set, which tops out at 10 s -- needs a HistogramBucketOverrides entry.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "sandbox-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 46
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(repro_heartbeat_staleness_bucket{namespace=\"$namespace\",service_name=\"temporal-core-sdk\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "sandbox-prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "p95 staleness"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "max(repro_heartbeat_throttle_ms{namespace=\"$namespace\",service_name=\"temporal-core-sdk\"}) or vector(0)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "sandbox-prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "throttle interval (upper bound)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
